      <details><summary>Section 5 - Products or Services</summary><div class="alma-terms-of-service__content"><p>Certain products or Services may be exclusively online, limited in quantity, and subject to return or exchange only according to our Refund Policy: [LINK TO REFUND POLICY]. We aim to display product colours and images accurately, but cannot guarantee your monitor’s display. We may limit sales, quantities, descriptions, pricing, or discontinue products at any time. We do not warrant that products, Services, information or material will meet expectations or that Service errors will be corrected.</p></div></details>
